# Shunter of the Month – Visual Reference (Design to Follow)

Use this when improving admin page or any card/section that should match the main-page "Shunter of the Month" card style.

## Reference component

- **File:** `src/components/User/ShunterOfTheMonthCard.jsx`
- **Context:** Rendered on main page (Calendar route) above the calendar.

---

## 1. Container (main card)

| Property | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Wrapper margin/padding | `mb-3 px-4 mt-2` |
| Max width | `max-w-4xl mx-auto` |
| Background | `bg-white/90 backdrop-blur-sm` (utility `card-modern`) |
| Border | `border border-slate-200/60` |
| Corners | `rounded-2xl` |
| Shadow | `shadow-lg` |
| Overflow | `overflow-hidden` (for header + expandable content) |

**Full container class:**  
`max-w-4xl mx-auto card-modern` (see `index.css` `@layer components`)

---

## 2. Expandable header (clickable bar)

| Property | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Layout | `w-full px-5 py-3.5 flex items-center justify-between` |
| Background | `bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-50 via-blue-50 to-slate-50` |
| Bottom border | `border-b border-slate-200/60` |
| Title text | `text-sm font-semibold text-slate-800` |
| Chevron | `motion.svg` from **framer-motion**, `w-5 h-5 text-slate-600`, `animate={{ rotate: open ? 180 : 0 }}` |
| Header control | `motion.button` with `whileHover` / `whileTap` scale |

---

## 3. Expandable content (body)

| Property | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Pattern | **`AnimatePresence`** + `{open && (` … `)}` — panel unmounts when closed |
| Wrapper | `motion.div` with `initial` / `animate` / `exit` on `height` + `opacity` (`duration: 0.3`, `easeInOut`) |
| Top border | `border-t border-slate-100` |
| Overflow | `overflow-hidden` on animated wrapper |
| Inner padding | `p-2 space-y-2` |

---

## 4. Inner row cards (e.g. per month)

| Property | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Padding | `px-4 py-3` |
| Corners | `rounded-xl` |
| Layout | `flex flex-col gap-1.5 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between` |
| Alternating backgrounds (4 variants) | `from-slate-50 to-blue-50/50 border-slate-200/60`, `from-blue-50/50 to-slate-50 border-blue-200/50`, `from-slate-50 to-purple-50/50 border-slate-200/60`, `from-purple-50/50 to-slate-50 border-purple-200/50` |
| Month label | `text-slate-700`, `text-blue-700`, `text-slate-700`, `text-purple-700` |
| Motion | Each row: `motion.div` with staggered `transition.delay` (`index * 0.08`) |
| Names/value text | `text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal` |
| Placeholder when empty | `text-sm text-gray-400` (e.g. "—") |

---

## 5. Loading state

| Property | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Same outer wrapper | `mb-3 px-4 mt-2` |
| Card shell | `max-w-4xl mx-auto card-modern px-4 py-3 min-h-[48px] flex items-center` |
| Skeleton | `h-4 w-40 bg-slate-100 rounded animate-pulse` |

---

## 6. Project colors (Tailwind config)

- **charcoal:** `#2D2D2D` – primary text (`text-charcoal`)
- **base.50–900:** neutral scale (design system guide) – `text-base-600`, `bg-base-100`, etc.
- **rota.*** – legacy planner / modals / forms (keep for rest of app)
- **offwhite, cream, softgray, mediumgray** – legacy utilities

---

## 7. Typography

- No custom font-family in theme; uses Tailwind default (system UI stack).
- Sizes used in reference: `text-xs`, `text-sm`, `font-semibold`, `font-bold`, `uppercase`, `tracking-wide`.

---

## 8. Responsive

- Card: full width with horizontal padding `px-4`; `max-w-4xl mx-auto` centers on large screens.
- Rows: stack on mobile (`flex-col gap-1.5`), row on `md:` (`md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between`).
- Names block: `flex flex-col gap-1` on mobile, `md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-6` on desktop.

---

## 9. Do not use (from old admin Shunter manager)

- Avoid `rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-yellow-50/80` for the **main/user-facing** Shunter card (that one uses gradient header + white card).
- **Admin sections** (e.g. Settings, Shunter of the Month Manager) **do** use red header + yellow container: card `border-red-200 bg-yellow-50/80`, header `bg-red-50 border-b border-red-200/60`, title `text-red-800`, content `bg-yellow-50/50 border-t border-red-100`.
- Avoid red header `bg-red-50` only on the **user-facing** Shunter card; prefer the slate / soft blue gradient header there (`from-slate-50 via-rota-page-bg-via to-slate-50`).

---

## 10. Summary checklist for new sections

- [ ] Container: `card-modern`, `max-w-4xl mx-auto`
- [ ] Outer wrapper: optional `motion.div` entrance (`opacity`, `y`)
- [ ] Expandable header: `motion.button`, gradient `from-slate-50 via-blue-50 to-slate-50`, `motion.svg` chevron
- [ ] Content: `AnimatePresence` + `motion.div` height/opacity animation; inner `p-2 space-y-2`
- [ ] Inner rows: `motion.div` stagger, `rounded-xl`, slate/blue/purple gradients, `shadow-sm hover:shadow-md`
- [ ] Text: `text-charcoal` for names, `text-xs`/`text-sm` for labels
- [ ] Responsive: `flex-col` + `md:flex-row` where needed
- [ ] Primary actions elsewhere may use `btn-primary` / `btn-secondary` from `index.css` (availability dialog pattern); this card header is a toggle, not a filled CTA
- [ ] Admin sections: red header + yellow container (card `border-red-200 bg-yellow-50/80`, header `bg-red-50`, title `text-red-800`, content `bg-yellow-50/50`).
- [ ] **Inner cards on yellow background:** use `bg-white` with colored border (e.g. `border-amber-200`, `border-blue-200`) so they contrast; do not use yellow/amber tints (e.g. `bg-amber-50`) on yellow container – they become invisible.
